"Application", "id": "1379423048586065", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1448850974976605"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1117160677338079"}]}, "change_log": "The TALENTS & KAFUKU Update!\r\n\r\n## NEW: Permanent TALENTS!\r\n\r\n- You can now unlock permanent **TALENTS** by sacrificing some of your Max Ki!\r\n- Each talent unlocks new abilities or improves your existing powers.\r\n- Talents stay with you permanently, even after death! This is currently the first way to save your progression in CRATERIZER.\r\n\r\n## NEW: KAFUKU Transformation!\r\n**KAFUKU** is one of the new unlockable talents, and it takes your powers to a whole new level!\r\n\r\nOnce you've unlocked the talent and have over 1,000 Max Ki, stand on the ground and hold both grips for 8 seconds to charge up and unleash KAFUKU!\r\n\r\n**While KAFUKU is active:**\r\n\r\n- **Epic Power Aura:** Surround yourself with an intense energy aura that matches your equipped power skin!\r\n- **Longer Teleports:** Teleport much farther than before.\r\n- **Teleport Through Terrain:** Teleport straight into the ground, carving tunnels as you go!\r\n- **Faster Flight:** Fly at incredible speeds!\r\n- **Body Drilling:** Fly fast enough and you'll smash straight through terrain, digging tunnels with your own body!\r\n- **Super Speed:** Run significantly faster! You'll still need to swing your arms to reach maximum speed.\r\n- **Enhanced Guided Ball:** Your blasts penetrate deeper into the terrain before exploding.\r\n- **Enhanced Chest Ray:** Fire a much thicker beam that tears through even more terrain!\r\n- **Bigger Orbs:** Unleash larger, more destructive Orbs that carve through the world like never before!\r\n\r\nKAFUKU continuously drains your Ki while active, so make every second count!\r\n\r\n## Smarter & More Dangerous INVADERS!\r\n\r\nInvaders are stepping up their game!\r\n\r\n- **Smarter Enemies:** Invaders have improved their combat tactics and will now put up a much tougher fight!\r\n- **Variable Squad Sizes:** Invader PODs can now deploy different numbers of enemies. Bigger squads mean tougher battles, but also greater Power rewards!\r\n- **POD Beacons:** Landed Invader PODs now emit visible beacons, making them easier to find. The beacon color also indicates the encounter's difficulty, so you'll know what you're getting into!\r\n\r\n## New Content & Improvements\r\n\r\n- **NEW Power Skin: Solar Flare!** Unleash your destructive powers with a fiery new look!\r\n- Improved the Menu UI for a cleaner and smoother experience.\r\n- Fixed an issue where grass remained visible after being destroyed by explosions.\r\n- Applied a potential fix for a bug that caused terrain to regenerate unexpectedly fast. Let me know if you still encounter it!", "created_date": 1793642652, "id": "1438838609311175", "version": "0.0.5", "version_code": 13, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1379423048586065", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1448850974976605"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1117160677338079"}]}, "change_log": "- Fix the last build removing a button that was added to the settings UI that wasnt intended for player use.", "created_date": 1793203095, "id": "1423122657549437", "version": "0.0.4", "version_code": 12, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "vi